{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1627.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"e9c5a2c8de76247317affc9fcbcb6341aab3a6fd0f91612159ca86a8791341e4","ja":"合成映像撮影に挑戦！","zh":"挑战合成影像拍摄！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1627.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"15c1728a1303b2374b9bb83912b1bb88804a5f26047506b6c1c5709e5a27e3b8","ja":"今日はリゾート地でロケ……という設定の撮影を\nスタジオで行う、という変わったお仕事で……","zh":"今天的工作挺特别的……\n是在影棚里拍摄，设定却是在度假胜地出外景……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1627.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"672a1e7275f1c99b9eb220864c83989255bab7c733a02f135a880f87dfe25dd3","ja":"「後で、グリーンバックに、リゾート地の映像を\n合成します。こんな感じになるんですが……」","zh":"“之后会把度假胜地的画面\n合成到绿幕上。效果大概是这样……”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1627.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"107236b39c037a16dacbe6665d340988dfc32b8b7de308ee835b8043e6de1df7","ja":"ねえねえ、私達、どんな風に映ってるの？","zh":"我说我说，我们在镜头里看起来怎么样？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1627.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"b3e1cd7797ea0bafb82aad109c0ef2347d6abffb6c10fdd30b09a293a2c5f8d5","ja":"すげーよ！\n本当に、海外のリゾート地にいるみたいだぜ！","zh":"太棒啦！\n简直就像真的来到了海外的度假胜地一样啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1627.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"28743911018fcdcf2e542c4f437770baab9cf1b436c9275a07dea52292e0582c","ja":"でも、やっぱりちょっと、違和感があるわね……。\n不自然にならないかしら？","zh":"不过，果然还是感觉有点违和呢……\n会不会显得不自然呀？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1627.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"ec2b92307185bc5d8a8df03187c52ce6f8d3e380ce89714c0254d863c6d3c282","ja":"「まあ、合成であることがバレバレの状態で\n進行する番組ですので」","zh":"“反正本就是个一眼就能看出来\n是合成画面的节目”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1627.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"d8780c851cf2a8bb2c1680c9c39f6737fdc8cebe8d520efe6ed4b082b3243cd3","ja":"「背景は、皆さんの演技に合わせて切り替えてくので、\nその場のノリで、自由に動いちゃってください！」","zh":"“背景会根据大家的表演进行切换，\n请大家跟着现场的气氛，自由发挥吧！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1627.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"aed24565eddf4c93d3efdecd27656d1cd0395ac817651d9943e6889447771bf2","ja":"面白い企画だよね～！　茜ちゃん、どんな場所がいいか\nリゾート地をいっぱい調べてきたよ♪","zh":"这个企划很有意思呢～！小茜，我想着去什么样的地方好，\n调查了好多度假胜地哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1627.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"55572341358f685285c2cf519ef62732ff6a73fdd59521da89bdfb25a904f659","ja":"私も！　女子力がアップするスポットを\nチェックしてたら、雑誌が付箋だらけになっちゃった♪","zh":"我也是！查着能提升女子力的地方，\n杂志上不知不觉贴满了便利贴♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1627.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"39662813fcf2d2ab05e4776e6873a90caa1ce87fdc34d63c6dae3cde661eeea0","ja":"やっぱりみんな、リサーチしてたんですね！\n私も、スイーツのお店をいっぱい探しちゃいました！","zh":"大家果然都提前调查过了呢！\n我也找了好多甜品店呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1627.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"c079043624913b092589eb0987d3aaa2ae9f794c73cd6a736dccb4c46aaf188f","ja":"ご当地スイーツ～♪　おいしいそうだな～♪\nぜーんぶ食べたいな～♪","zh":"当地甜点～♪　看起来真好吃～♪\n好想全部都尝个遍呀～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1627.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"bcb76749af70481bcb46154fea56ef9081a2cf87f373f8e04a5f094de6686656","ja":"私も、観光雑誌を持参しました。世界遺産の\n美しい滝の映像を、ご提案させていただこうかと。","zh":"我也带了旅游杂志过来。想向您提议\n拍摄世界遗产中那座美丽的瀑布。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1627.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"24eb0dde7e99b2cade44a0e7790a595054e86b610c886165ce44a946ad073415","ja":"ホエールウォッチングも面白そうだよな！\n大迫力の映像で、絶対感動すると思うぜ！","zh":"观鲸看起来也挺有意思的啊！\n超震撼的影像，肯定会让人感动得不得了吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1627.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"650a55c031502e3f1570ff083b591722a347693cff293e2f5f18901c7467c2a8","ja":"どれも面白そうね。\n本当に行けたら、とっても楽しいバカンスになりそう♪","zh":"哪个看起来都很有意思呢。\n要是真能去的话，肯定会是一次非常愉快的假期♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1627.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"77fb62feef391a69467ce8f2135a0deb23c95631f42cfb0c8d3db724b29fec9a","ja":"はい。ですが……実在しないものをあるように\n振る舞うということが、なかなかつかめなくて。","zh":"是的。可是……要把不存在的事物表现得\n像存在一样，我总有些把握不好。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1627.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"eb8dbc1ed2e811e6362b0fdad6ab6610fad8580a8bb4cf65b5ad4413be24663a","ja":"紬ちゃんも？　実は私も、イメージだけで\n上手くリポートできるか、ちょっと不安で……。","zh":"小紬也是吗？其实我也觉得单凭想象\n能不能做好报道，有点心里没底……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1627.unity3d","item_key":"commands[57].text","source_sha256":"dcdc7d8c3cb50f8b890fadd9f433e78bb8078f859c29e9997fc71faf0c1da4d4","ja":"私もよくわかんないけど……\nでもとりあえず、やってみたらいいんじゃないかな？","zh":"我也搞不太懂……\n不过总之，先试着做做看不就好了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1627.unity3d","item_key":"commands[58].text","source_sha256":"e201b17f6199838c9625cd03e11d582bfc8d8f684f1994fc5e25e99f0fe53942","ja":"例えば……じゃあみんな、イメージしてみて！\nここは、青い海が広がる素敵なビーチだって！","zh":"比方说……大家，想象一下！\n这里是一片蔚蓝大海延展的美丽海滩！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1627.unity3d","item_key":"commands[59].text","source_sha256":"8dc05e27c5030523eb12fc20511030bff1c4f6ae901174253e18085fbb9126dd","ja":"えっ！？　いきなり！？","zh":"诶！？这么突然！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1627.unity3d","item_key":"commands[60].text","source_sha256":"70fd0de209de79650e74c0f9d096da91236050689f5c75d49002c6c9b2f9fec5","ja":"いいからいいから！　ほらみんな、目を閉じて、\n太陽がまぶしい浜辺にいる自分を想像してみて！","zh":"别管那么多啦！来，大家闭上眼睛，\n想象自己正置身于阳光耀眼的海滩上！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
